  "bio": "Dennis Dwyer is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Tucson, Arizona. Renowned for his illustrative tattoo style and world class, award-winning work, Dennis ensures each piece of art is carefully crafted to perfection. His professionalism is reflected not only in the stunning tattoos he creates but also in the clean and safe environment he maintains at his studio, Ancient Art Tattoo in Tucson.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Tucson, Arizona, United States\n\nAncient Art Tattoo\nPermanent Cosmetics\nPrecision Tattoo Supply\n2108 S. Alvernon Way, Tucson Arizona\n520 747-3340 \nWorld class, award-winning tattoos.",
